    "task_description": "Add a shared timezone-aware UTC helper in `app/time_utils.py`.\n\nImplement:\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n\n\ndef utc_now() -> datetime:\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n```\n\nUpdate `app/services/workspace/context_service.py` so the existing\n`exported_at` field uses:\n\n```python\n\"exported_at\": utc_now().isoformat(),\n```\n\ninstead of `datetime.utcnow().isoformat()`.\n\nRemove the now-unused local `datetime` import from `context_service.py`.\n\nAdd focused deterministic coverage in\n`app/tests/test_utc_now_helper.py` proving that `utc_now()` returns a\ntimezone-aware datetime whose UTC offset is zero.\n\nModify exactly:\n\n* `app/time_utils.py`\n* `app/services/workspace/context_service.py`\n* `app/tests/test_utc_now_helper.py`\n\nDo not migrate any other `datetime.utcnow()` call.\nDo not modify API endpoints, models, queue logic, planner code, provider\nconfiguration, workspace infrastructure, recovery code, or unrelated tests."
  },
