    "task_description": "Add a shared timezone-aware UTC helper and migrate the workspace context export timestamp to use it.\n\nCreate `app/time_utils.py` containing:\n\n```python\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n\n\ndef utc_now() -> datetime:\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n```\n\nUpdate `app/services/workspace/context_service.py` so:\n\n* it imports `utc_now` from `app.time_utils`;\n* `exported_at` uses `utc_now().isoformat()`;\n* the now-unused `datetime` import is removed;\n* no unrelated behavior changes.\n\nCreate `app/tests/test_utc_now_helper.py` with deterministic tests proving:\n\n* the result is timezone-aware;\n* the offset is UTC;\n* the result is reasonably close to the current UTC time without asserting exact equality.\n\nModify exactly these three paths:\n\n```text\napp/time_utils.py\napp/services/workspace/context_service.py\napp/tests/test_utc_now_helper.py\n```\n\nDo not change any fourth file.\n\nRun the focused candidate validation and required static checks."
